  "readmeFile": "readme.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## v6.0.0 Major release\n\n### Changes\n\n- The new supported target frameworks are .NET 8.0, .NET 10.0, .NET 4.7.2, .NET Standard 2.1\n- Drops .NET 6, 9 and .NET Standard 2.0 support\n- #516 Change ClosureInfo into CompilerContext (should be transparent for existing code)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- #553 CompileFast returns wrong values when a member is accessed on an interface converted to a struct\n- #536 Exception System.IndexOutOfRangeException with value objects implicit conversions starting from v5.0.3\n\n### Performance Improvements\n\n- #489 Try interpret a switch expression - if switch value is interpretable (constant) then select a single matched branch\n- #375 Use UnsafeAccess in net8+ and UnsafeAccessType in net10+\n- #135 Optimize Branches to Small Branches\n- #351 Use internals of DynamicMethod",
